        "x1": 0.9199934640522875,
        "y1": 0.5616287878787879
      },
      "text": "Next, following the same line of thoughts as those in Section V-B, and removing Aj− and Ai− from the right-hand side (75) and subsequent equations, it is not hard to arrive at the following upper bound for probability of symbol error for the present case.",
